<title>UK: BOE buys 650 mln stg bills/FRG at 5-31/32 percent.</title>
<headline>BOE buys 650 mln stg bills/FRG at 5-31/32 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it bought bills/FRG totalling 650 million stg for resale to the market on November 18 at 5-31/32 percent.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.2 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    650 MLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BILLS/FRG TO NOV 18  650 MLN#   =	    =	    =</p>
<p>INTEREST RATE 5-31/32 PERCENT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE</p>
<p>RATES)</p>
</text>
